(   5. Word 5: Checksum \(16 bits, mandatory error checking across pseudo-header, TCP header, and) Tj
T*
(   data\) and Urgent Pointer \(16 bits, offset pointing to priority data when URG is set\).) Tj
T*
(   6. Optional Words: Options \(0-40 bytes, including MSS, Window Scale, SACK Permitted, and) Tj
T*
(   Timestamps\) padded to a 32-bit boundary.) Tj
T*
() Tj
