(   Solutions:) Tj
T*
(   1. Clark's Solution \(Receiver\): The receiver is forbidden from advertising tiny window) Tj
T*
(   increases. It advertises rwnd = 0 until it can offer a window of at least one full MSS or half) Tj
T*
(   of its total buffer space.) Tj
T*
(   2. Nagle's Algorithm \(Sender\): If unacknowledged data exists in flight, the sender buffers) Tj
T*
(   outgoing application data until either a full MSS is accumulated or an ACK for outstanding data) Tj
T*
(   is received.) Tj
T*
