(   Max Throughput = 65,535 * 8 / 0.1 s = 5.24 Mbps \(utilizing less than 0.1% of link capacity!\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   Window Scale Option \(RFC 1323\):) Tj
T*
(   During handshake, endpoints negotiate a scale factor \(0 to 14\). Window values are left-shifted) Tj
T*
(   by this factor, expanding the maximum usable window up to 1 Gigabyte \(65,535 * 2^14\), allowing) Tj
T*
(   complete saturation of modern ultra-high-speed networks.) Tj
T*
