12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Describe the mechanics of TCP Reset \(RST\) generation and its legitimate vs malicious uses.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   The RST flag in the TCP header is used to instantly abort a connection and signal an abnormal) Tj
T*
