(   4. accept\(\): Blocks until an incoming connection completes the 3-way handshake; returns a new) Tj
T*
(   connected socket descriptor.) Tj
T*
(   5. read\(\) / recv\(\) & write\(\) / send\(\): Exchanges payload bytes with the client.) Tj
T*
(   6. close\(\): Closes the connected socket descriptor.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   Client Side:) Tj
T*
(   1. socket\(\): Creates an endpoint socket descriptor.) Tj
T*
(   2. connect\(\): Initiates 3-way handshake to the server's IP and port; blocks until established.) Tj
T*
(   3. write\(\) / send\(\) & read\(\) / recv\(\): Transmits requests and receives responses.) Tj
T*
(   4. close\(\): Initiates graceful 4-way teardown handshake.) Tj
